# Concerted Care only targets an artifact or creature its caster controls: Bot2's Ornithopter is refused as a target (with Bot1's
# own Llanowar Elves, the positive control, accepted). With the Elves as the target Bot2 answers with a Lightning Bolt, so
# the Adventure's only target is gone as it would resolve and it does nothing (CR 608.2b). A spell cast as an Adventure that
# leaves the stack any way but resolving is not exiled (CR 715.4): Bofur goes to the graveyard and cannot be cast from
# exile (there is no exiled card to cast).

